<title>BELGIUM: RESEARCH ALERT - KB cut CBR to 'reduce'.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - KB cut CBR to 'reduce'.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research report -</p>
<p>Co name-----------Sector------Price------Broker-------------</p>
<p>CBR		   Cement	 3,350 *   KB Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Downdraded to reduce from accumulate. Stock considered fully valued given the prospect of flat earnings in 1997. Stock currently trading at BEF 3,350 implying a P/E of 17.5 for 1997. This compares with 15.9 for Lafarge.</p>
<p>Recommendation: 'REDUCE' (ACCUMULATE).</p>
<p>Analyst: Pascale WEBER, 32 2 546 41 06</p>
<p>(*) in bfr; date of research report: 07/07/97</p>
<p> Estimates:   EPS	  pvs est   P/E   Gross dividend</p>
<p> 1997E	  191 BFR    (n/a)    17.5     102.0 BFR</p>
<p> 1998E	  213 BFR    (n/a)    15.7     110.0 BFR</p>
<p>(If you wish to have your research published on Reuters, contact the Brussels Newsroom on +32 2 287 6810 or fax it to +32 2 230 7710.)</p>
